"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"French firefighters are trying to stop a big fire from reaching Bordeaux. In Madrid, officials say they are dealing with the worst fire the region has ever seen.\",            \"english_title\": \"Firefighters Battle Fires\",            \"translated_version\": \"Bomberos franceses tratan de parar un gran fuego que no llegue a Burdeos. En Madrid, dicen que tienen el peor fuego que han visto.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Bomberos luchan contra fuegos\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"An event with important people from the Ukrainian defense industry was attacked by missiles during the day.\",            \"english_title\": \"Missile Attack on Event\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un evento con personas importantes de la industria de defensa de Ucrania fue atacado por misiles durante el d\u00eda.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataque de misiles en evento\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Iran is upset about the US plan to use frozen Iranian money to pay for war damages.\",            \"english_title\": \"Iran Upset Over US Plan\",            \"translated_version\": \"Ir\u00e1n est\u00e1 molesto por el plan de EE.UU. de usar dinero congelado de Ir\u00e1n para pagar da\u00f1os de guerra.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ir\u00e1n molesto por plan de EE.UU.\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Protests are happening because Zelensky decided to remove Mykhailo Fedorov from his position. Some people think this decision has hurt Zelensky politically.\",            \"english_title\": \"Protests Over Zelensky Decision\",            \"translated_version\": \"Hay protestas porque Zelensky decidi\u00f3 quitar a Mykhailo Fedorov de su puesto. Algunas personas piensan que esto ha da\u00f1ado a Zelensky pol\u00edticamente.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Protestas por decisi\u00f3n de Zelensky\"        },        {         